      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define “trip” as an “instance of a person’s travel” described by “path or trajectory” and “destination”; it discusses “individual trip destination prediction” and “historical trajectory data,” but does not provide a standalone definition of the term “trip.”",
